sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as App or web
  participant R as PostgREST
  participant P as db_pre_request()
  participant T as Tables with RLS
  C->>R: request with JWT + X-Tenant-Id (the open book)
  R->>P: runs before every request
  P->>P: profile from auth.uid()
  P->>P: X-Tenant-Id a live membership? else profile_setting.active_tenant_id, else a book of yours
  P-->>R: request.tenant_id · profile_id · role
  R->>T: query or RPC
  Note over T: SELECT → the open book only<br/>bookings, receipts, tags, shopping → any member<br/>accounts, categories, goals, loans, rules → owner or admin
  T-->>C: rows — a refused write matches 0 rows, no error
  Note over C,T: Realtime and Storage skip db_pre_request: realtime reads every book you belong to, storage checks the path's book
